{"synopsis":"Ye Junlin, yang dipersenjatai dengan sistem “Kekuatan Melalui Kesulitan”, mendapati dirinya di ambang kematian, hanya untuk memulai perjalanan kultivasi yang tak tertandingi tanpa batas. Kaisar Abadi? Orang Bijak? Dao Surgawi? Mereka semua harus tunduk padanya! Selain itu, ia telah menerima beberapa murid. Murid tertuanya, pemimpin sekte iblis yang kejam dan licik, selalu menjadi patuh setelah didisiplinkan. Murid keduanya, seorang gadis loli berambut putih dengan fisik surgawi terkuat di bawah langit, meskipun kekuatannya luar biasa, menemukan kegembiraan dalam memasak dan melayani tuannya dengan pengabdian yang luar biasa.","alternative_title":"Limitless Ascension: Strength Amid Adversity, As I Become Stronger When I Meet a Strong Opponent, My Cultivation Has No Upper Limit, My cultivation has no limits, 遇强则强，我的修为无上限, Yu Qiang Ze Qiang, Wo De Xiu Wei Wu Shang Xian, Força Através da Adversidade, Meu Cultivo Não Tem Limites","author":"火珑果漫画","artist":"火珑果漫画","chapters":[{"number":"129","chapter":"129","slug":"f6200a35-68fc-40c0-b360-da27337655a0","title":"Chapter 129","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"128","chapter":"128","slug":"6003556f-9783-4c69-b7d6-a002a915cae3","title":"Chapter 128","date":"2026-08-02"},{"number":"127","chapter":"127","slug":"8630ff0b-0639-49ef-a01f-8de48e36ed87","title":"Chapter 127","date":"2026-07-31"},{"number":"126","chapter":"126","slug":"26627534-7654-4227-84ee-08a8e707dfe3","title":"Chapter 126","date":"2026-07-19"},{"number":"125","chapter":"125","slug":"c2ee8b6e-ea57-4e3e-8c70-82f7e4e2254b","title":"Chapter 125","date":"2026-07-11"},{"number":"124","chapter":"124","slug":"46cc22eb-8045-4a0c-9a3d-179ae1e20e83","title":"Chapter 124","date":"2026-07-02"},{"number":"123","chapter":"123","slug":"d4156ff6-2cf0-41b6-9742-fd952571b025","title":"Chapter 123","date":"2026-06-28"},{"number":"122","chapter":"122","slug":"871adc9a-69cb-46f8-953c-b8d1a82ab136","title":"Chapter 122","date":"2026-06-25"},{"number":"121","chapter":"121","s